  "title": "She invented Monopoly and got $500. The man who sold it became a millionaire",
  "question": "$500 for Monopoly?",
  "format": "world",
  "description": "In 1904 Lizzie Magie patented The Landlord's Game to show how renting makes landlords rich. Thirty years later Charles Darrow sold a copy as his own, Parker Brothers paid him royalties, and he became a millionaire. Lizzie got $500. The true story, in a minute.",
  "pillar": "company stories",
